Q1.
Display all students.

SELECT *
FROM students;


Q2.
Display only name and age.

SELECT name, age
FROM students;


Q3.
Display name and marks, with marks appearing
as score.

SELECT name, marks AS score
FROM students;


Q4.
Display name and age + 5, with the calculated
column named age_after_5_years.

SELECT name, age + 5 AS age_after_5_years
FROM students;


